      "writtenOn": "2020-07-23T21:27:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From the spec, we need to support the extended battery cap message. Page 228, Table 6-67 Applicability of Extended Messages.\n\nThe table sets Extended Battery Cap message to CN1 for Transmit and CN4 for Receive.\n\nCN – Conditional Normative ; Shall be supported by a given Port/Cable Plug based on features\n\nNote 1: Shall be supported by products that contain batteries.\nNote 4: Shall be supported by products that can transmit the Get_Battery_Cap Message.",
      "parentUuid": "860ca79c_5f5d6e93",
      "revId": "94076486f5876b7a3085e6a01cea82f3371dde30",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
